              },
              {
                "content": "Convert the given content into html format. Do not include html``` and ```. Refer to the example below:\n<h2 id=\"h_01JXYM3SPWW1Y0ZFBK0DZ73FDN\">Issue Description:</h2>\n<p>\n  Users need to enable log upload in the Agora Web SDK to send SDK logs to Agora's\n  servers for debugging and troubleshooting purposes.\n</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JXYM42P5KQPG78V3E24TME8E\">Platform/SDK:</h2>\n<p>Agora Web SDK (v4.x)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JXYM48GYGS6VA4H34BEMJXM4\">Error Message (optional):</h2>\n<p>N/A</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JXYM4DGP0793VHZV0FZ2C89H\">Step by Step Solution:</h2>\n<h3 id=\"h_01JXYM4JVGXY22EWEFD0FTJZ8H\">\n  1. <strong>Enable Log Upload:</strong>\n</h3>\n<p>\n  - Use the <code>enableLogUpload()</code> method from the <code>AgoraRTC</code>\n  global interface to start uploading logs.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <code>AgoraRTC.enableLogUpload();</code>\n</p>\n<p>\n  This begins automatic log uploads immediately with no parameters required.\n</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01JXYM4NRY5Q8B0TPF92XBD3HV\">\n  2. <strong>(Optional) Set Log Level:</strong>\n</h3>\n<p>\n  - To manage which logs are recorded and uploaded, apply the\n  <code>setLogLevel()</code> function with the desired log level:\n</p>\n<p>\n  <code>AgoraRTC.setLogLevel(AgoraRTC.LOG_LEVEL.DEBUG); // For the most detailed logs</code>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <code>or</code>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <code>AgoraRTC.setLogLevel(AgoraRTC.LOG_LEVEL.INFO); // Default setting</code>\n</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01JXYM4VJNNNTXXSX951B4GKBW\">\n  3. <strong>(Optional) Disable Log Upload:</strong>\n</h3>\n<p>\n  - When logging is no longer needed, stop the log uploads using:\n</p>\n<p>\n  <code>AgoraRTC.disableLogUpload();</code>\n</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JXYM4ZQ4DVCDQ5N523EX5T1S\">Root Cause:</h2>\n<p>\n  Users require a mechanism to gather and upload logs for debugging purposes when\n  they encounter audio/video issues or connection problems, which the SDK supports\n  via the <code>enableLogUpload</code> function.\n</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JXYM563BGHWZ7MHRT783K2RM\">Prevention/Best Practice:</h2>\n<p>\n  Always set an appropriate log level to ensure only necessary information is collected\n  and shared. Be cautious about leaving log upload enabled in production environments\n  unless required for ongoing troubleshooting. Example\n</p>\n<pre><code>javascript\n// Initialize AgoraRTC and enable logs\nAgoraRTC.setLogLevel(AgoraRTC.LOG_LEVEL.DEBUG); // Optional\nAgoraRTC.enableLogUpload(); // Start uploading logs\n\n// Later, if needed:\nAgoraRTC.disableLogUpload(); // Stop uploading</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JXYM593KRCQ9EEHPGXJKTR0B\">Corresponding Document/Link (optional):</h2>\n<p>\n  - <a href=\"#\">AgoraRTC.enableLogUpload() Documentation</a>\n</p>\n<p>\n  - <a href=\"#\">AgoraRTC.setLogLevel() Documentation</a>\n</p>\n",
                "role": "system"
              }
            ]
