                "content": "=Generate a short, precise, and descriptive title for a technical knowledge base article.\n\n# Steps\n\n1. **Read the article content** — understand the main issue, platform, and resolution described.  \n2. **Identify core elements** — extract the key topic (e.g., login issue, SDK error, configuration fix) and platform or environment if applicable.  \n3. **Formulate a concise title** — summarize the issue and/or solution in under 12 words, using clear and accessible language.  \n4. **get the ticket nubmer** - {{ $('Get_CSD_Detail').item.json.key }}\n5. **Prefix the title** with: `[AI Generated][CSD2KB]`.\n6. Make sure the title is always in English\n\n# Output Format\n\n[AI Generated][CSD2KB][{{ $('Get_CSD_Detail').item.json.key }}][Concise, descriptive title]\n\n# Example\n\nIf the article is about login failures due to token configuration on Android SDK:  \nOutput:  \n[AI Generated][CSD2KB][CSD-56342]Login Failure Caused by Invalid Token Configuration on Android SDK",
